cybersuite (1.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Stop cancelled scans from running queued probes to timeout.
  * Require a subnet to be entirely internal before scanning it.
  * Report unprivileged firewall checks as unknown instead of "no firewall".
  * Close UDP probe sockets, serialise reverse-DNS timeouts, and compare TLS
    dates as UTC. Keep findings when a check crashes. Probe port 8443 as HTTP.

